@@ -442,3 +442,9 @@ ## 9. Backlog (next pieces, in order)
 
 Team rules for this backlog: run the PHPStan stopgap before each push; migration timestamps from
 `2026_11_06_200000` up.
+
+## 26 November 2026 — full-demo workspace presentation, first slice
+
+Owner/coordinator authorized the next isolated presentation slice after comparing the full uploaded HTML. The Dispensary list now uses three live server-count cards and a contextual helpful-information panel, with navigation to the existing Returns page only for `dispensary.view.branch`. Cards use the existing tab query; search, pagination, visible-only polling and case/label actions keep their existing handlers. The panel can be hidden and its sections disclosed without navigation. Desktop supports a side panel; narrower screens retain patient cards with help below the list.
+
+This is partial demo parity: the owner-established three states remain, Verify completes the case, return checking remains on the case, and there is no All branches grant, Ready state, follow-up or default return reason. New filters/enriched clinical data are outside this slice. Existing assertions were not changed. Validation/package evidence is recorded by the coordinator in `dispensary-workspace`; publication awaits final review and owner approval.
